<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge unchanged at 75.2001 per dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge unchanged at 75.2001 per dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.2001 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.2001 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     March 18		March 17</p>
